LiquidationPeriphery::setMarketRegistry
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── when new market registry is zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when new market registry is already set
│   └── it should revert with AlreadySet
└── when new market registry is valid and different
    ├── it should emit MarketRegistrySet
    └── it should update market registry
